{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本標準依都市危險及老舊建築物加速重建條例(以下簡稱本條例)第七條規\n\n定訂定之。","id":"臺東縣-GL000491/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"20bf9498416753a28f20a8b9cf301de375ccf883e38d1b5df2d0ea3aa7a3cfc0","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"依本條例申請重建之案件，其建築物高度，除因飛航安全管制外，不受建\n\n築法令及都市計畫法令之建築高度限制。","id":"臺東縣-GL000491/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"fc7a4eb5302bedcc8fb00ace3b7d86bab9805f1c7f3469b26e15f107400ee80e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"臺東縣-GL000491/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"41d99ab05c826cb9d18b46a4338a969181059b291f00d1710c5002864bb303e1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[],"category":"都市更新與危老","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"臺東縣-GL000491","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"臺東縣都市危險及老舊建築物加速重建建築物高度放寬標準","region":"臺東縣","source":"臺東縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://law.taitung.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000491","retrieved":"2026-09-28T09:57:23+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"e2d4d8b92a2b5bc61c23fdd0d8e3d9df8c107388cc150f469df34024aac3fd99","sourceRecordId":"臺東縣-GL000491","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T10:03:59+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}